# Intentionally empty.
#
# conftest.py points MUSICBOT_ENV_FILE at this file so the test suite never loads
# a deployed environment file. app/config/settings.py searches PROJECT_ROOT/.env
# first, so on an installed host (setup_server.sh writes /opt/<instance>/.env) the
# suite would otherwise pull that instance's BOT_TOKEN, INSTANCE_ID, RUNTIME_PATH
# and BOT_RELOAD_SENTINEL_PATH into os.environ — leaking production secrets into
# tests and into every subprocess that copies os.environ.
#
# Tests that need specific settings set MUSICBOT_ENV_FILE themselves.
